    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="e106bfae-4130-5c7e-88d7-b530f779c3e2" activityNameId="2b06754d-2bfe-509f-bfef-f308fb1ae963" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Bitumen adhesive compound, cold, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Bitumen adhesive compound, cold, at plant
The dataset is applicable in the construction building sector. Bitumen adhesive compound is used to protect roads and roofs against water intrusion.;
Synonyms: cold bonding compound, Kaltkleber; 
UUID: add499d7-1625-3e50-a85b-06400167b589
The dataset describes the production of cold bitumen adhesive compound. Included sub-processes are the mixing of bitumen and solvent, the infrastructure, the transport by road and rail as well as the disposal of the compound cuttings in a hazardous waste municipal incineration.
Location: The data of this dataset is extracted from literature and producer information. Some own calculations (e.g. energy input, waste heat) were made.
Technology: The technology involved is mixing of bitumen and solvent in a cold process.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature, database 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: The used data is mainly valid for Central Europe, the dataset is applicable for the whole European region.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_add499d7-1625-3e50-a85b-06400167b589.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
